;;
;; Script ATS V2
;; Logos
;; The logos cut's own events, on its frames: from skip.open TRIANGLE or START skips
;; to opening.txt's skip_to; at station.switch the station's scene takes over.
;;

ats 2 logos

time        frames 30
clock       cut
event       skip.open       frame 300
event       station.switch  frame 900
